#ASSERT (position (`an unsubstantiated case of` FALSE FALSE))'s `only the Commission may bring proceedings` EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT (position (`a case of` `s 9 misleading or deceptive conduct in trade` TRUE TRUE `an individual`))'s `only the Commission may bring proceedings` EQUALS FALSE
-- D9
#ASSERT (position (`an unsubstantiated case of` FALSE FALSE))'s `maximum fine` EQUALS 600000
#ASSERT `the maximum fine for contravening` `s 12A an unsubstantiated representation in trade` `, by` `an individual` `, the Crown:` FALSE EQUALS 200000

